<title>SPAIN: CYCLING-ZABEL WINS RUTA DEL SOL.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-ZABEL WINS RUTA DEL SOL.</headline>
<dateline>GRANADA, Spain 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Erik Zabel of Germany was the overall winner of the Ruta del Sol cycling race, which ended on Thursday.</p>
<p>Zabel had led the classification since Sunday's first stage.</p>
